Name: gleam
Short Name: gleam
URL: https://github.com/servo/gleam
Version: 0.16.0
Revision: ebf9bb015219e2a082be2defef18ba23670b005e
Update Mechanism: Manual (tools/import.py gleam, history replayed linearly)
License: MIT OR Apache-2.0
License File: N/A (see the crate manifests)
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes

Description:
Generated OpenGL bindings and wrapper for Servo.

Local Modifications:
The crates (1) live in third_party/gleam/<crate>, one directory per package; their manifests are rewritten by
tools/flatten.py (path dependencies, inlined workspace inheritance, one version per crate) and patched by
tools/fixups.sh and tools/patches/. Everything else of the upstream is in third_party/gleam/ unchanged.

Crates:
  gleam 0.16.0 third_party/gleam/gleam
